Modifications: reimplementation in Rust on candle, CPU only, 48 kHz mono output.
The model packages are not distributed with this repository;
scripts/export_silero.py derives the tensors locally from v5_ru.pt
(sha256 7ba04d42340fe0398042eed2e0d12d62e23096d626b1b9feff4dcb1309197ab4),
scripts/export_silero_cis.py from v5_cis_ext.pt
(sha256 e8185323fc5a341c229f8a8c9928512f665bf2736021bc600512499d0506eed2,
licensed CC BY-NC), scripts/export_silero_cis_nostress.py from
v5_cis_base_nostress.pt (sha256 0405777e332906f0644e08a680f7cfdc2137ea864090079c1fdd30a43c1b8761,
MIT), and scripts/export_accentor_uk.py from the silero-stress accentor
(sha256 3a64944182f7e34ef831e990dc807246161e20c14c923506db0a20b8120ce13c, MIT,
https://github.com/snakers4/silero-stress).

